# rh_cli.elisa — command entry point (M01-01, M01-07, M01-08, M06-01 lite).
#
# Subcommands: scan, replay, sign, verify, serve, registry, version, help.
# Exit codes: 0 ok (or replay/signature verified), 1 internal/test failure,
# 2 usage, 3 rejected input (unknown/unsafe/unsupported), 4 collection/
# computation failure, 5 replay mismatch or signature mismatch. stdout
# carries reports; stderr carries diagnostics.

